<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - TBN 50,000-55,000 tonnes coal Mobile/Rotterdam 15-30/10 $5.95 fio 25,000 shinc/25,000 shinc Ruhrkohle.</p>
<p>ORE - Sol - (built 1973) 120,000 tonnes Boca Grande/Constanza 20-30/10 $6.00 fio 20,000 shinc/20,000 shex Farnet.</p>
<p>TBN 100,000 tonnes ore Goa/Constanza 10-20/10 $6.25 fio 16,000 shinc/17,000 shinc Sidex. Fixtures reported from New York on Monday.</p>
<p>IRON ORE - Marshal Grechko 110,000 long tons Nouadhibou/Antwerp 20-30/10 $3.90 five days Cobelfret.</p>
</text>
